mpse of the \"exciting world there.\"\n<br><br>\n\"Nozomi...I want to play in a girls' band!\"\n<br><br>\nThe story of Mizuki who became a high-school student begins now! This is a rockin' youth story woven by the four individual girls from the music band at Hakumai High School in a town in Hokkaido!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Taiban! Official YouTube channel, edited)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 5}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 7, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#タイバン #拍舞高校軽音部 #好きあらば自語り", "genres": ["Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Band", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cute Girls Doing Cute Things", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School Club", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136646, "title": {"romaji": "Ndaho Kekkon Omedetou!!", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Animation released to celebrate YouTube channel Fischer's member Ndaho getting married.", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 4}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music", "Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 136657, "title": {"romaji": "Sansan De Shenghuo Guoran You Wenti", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 10, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 136664, "title": {"romaji": "Lockdown", "english": "Lockdown"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video animated by omy for the song <i>Lockdown</i> by PIKASONIC and Tatsunoshin featuring virtual singer NEONA.", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 136706, "title": {"romaji": "Tomorrow’s Leaves", "english": "Tomorrow’s Leaves"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "<i> Tommorow's Leaves</i> is a special project commissioned by the Olympic Foundation for Culture and Heritage (OFCH), \nanimated by Studio Ponoc, made for the Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games.<br><br>\nThe annual arrival of the message leaf causes concern – something is undeniably wrong.\nIts usually vibrant and lasting colours quickly fade, and it suddenly withers and crumbles.\nFive envoys, from five diverse lands, are dispatched to find out what has happened.\nThe envoys travel to a distant land, quietly guided by tiny spirits. Each envoy has its own strengths and vulnerabilities. They compete and support each other as they draw closer to their destination, facing treacherous terrain and difficult conditions. Through athletic challenges and the uniting power of sport, they discover the positive fundamental values that come with playful competition.\nTogether, the envoys approach near the source of the message leaf.\nCan they restore life to a future in peril? <br>\n<br>\n(Source: International Olympic Committee) <br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: Premiered early on June 14, 2021 at the Annecy International Animated Film Festival, ahead of the cultural programme at Tokyo 2020. Also premiered at the Tokyo Skytree Round Theater on July 12, 2021.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#TomorrowsLeaves", "genres": ["Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Environmental", "rank": 84, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Child Cast", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ships", "rank": 45, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Swimming", "rank": 33, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Fishing", "rank": 33, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Aviation", "rank": 33, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tanned Skin", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136779, "title": {"romaji": "Rhythmens", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "An animated mini web series by Korean studio VCRWORKS", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 6, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Outdoor Activities", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Rural", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Episodic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136795, "title": {"romaji": "Natsu ga Hajimaru.", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A CalorieMate web movie directed by Takumi Shiga featuring the song \"Surges\" by Orangestar, with vocals by Kase and Loin.\nThe video carries an eclectic animation style, as the story follows high school students from various clubs pouring their effort into sports in the second year of the coronavirus pandemic. <br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network, edited) <br><br>\n<i>Note: Initially published on the Otsuka Pharmaceutical Official YouTube channel in July 2021, it was later reuploaded on Orangestar's YouTube channel under the song title \"Surges\", republished on August 12, 2021.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#夏がはじまる #カロ